      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "In the pinned implementation, the server-wide byte totals aggregate samples across collections. When sampling is disabled for a collection, its per-collection tracker is removed from the tracker map without subtracting the server-wide byte totals. Configuration refresh replaces the collection-tracker map while leaving those totals intact. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/mongo/r8.0.0/src/mongo/s/query_analysis_sample_tracker.h",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:42372f940c019a46e37ca807109eac3a4c963d48d013e0fabb352db370300ea4",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:06b1d27302b716d32d6accd30b5f6b0db3f9339eeeefc5a616e31e3d25b03427",
            "ev:0970ef6eab412248a403daf9648e292c41f781b8adca891b45402e1690a87164",
            "ev:7bdf1306e58a317f45050c49c89c1efd2148f3b6541d9211a3c8f95cc263f167",
            "ev:7f1e9c5b06b54deb87e34b0711077a09fb9c321f8a6cf29a4c1c5bf6d83c018e",
